SUMMARY:Harris Lake Bike Demo Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261101T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261101T110000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052647Z
UID:event_316896058@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261101T090000
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261018T130821Z
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\nCurious about your next mou
 ntain bike? Join Triangle Off-Road Cyclists (TORC) for a morning of bike d
 emos and community at Harris Lake.\n\nWeâre bringing local bike shops
  together to give riders a chance to explore different brands and learn ab
 out both traditional\, pedal-powered mountain bikes and electric-assist mo
 untain bikes. Talk with shop teams about bike fit\, features\, and the opt
 ions that suit your riding.\nOur goal is to help more people discover moun
 tain biking\, connect riders with the businesses supporting our riding com
 munity\, and offer a welcoming setting to compare bikes and ask questions.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T130822Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
