DESCRIPTION:Join a Ranger to create an animal sculpture using Model Magic A
 ir Dry Clay! We will provide all materials\, and participants may keep the
 ir sculpture at no cost. This Art in the Park program bridges the worlds o
 f nature and the visual arts\, creating a meaningful connection between th
 e two.\n\nReservations are required due to limited supplies\, so RSVP by e
 mailing mayo.river@ncparks.gov\n\nParticipants can use their own imaginati
 on to create any animal\; however\, visual aids and guidance from a Ranger
  will be available. \n\nWe will meet at the Shelter at Mayo Mountain Acces
 s on Sunday\, November 1st at 1 PM.
