UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53973578531513
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DESCRIPTION:In this self-paced\, 15-hour course\, educators explore an arts
 -based approach to social emotional learning through themes of Mindfulness
 \, Identity\, Perspective Sharing\, Community Building\, and Agency. They 
 will participate in experiences that model growth and development of justi
 ce-oriented\, global citizens. A certificate of participation for 15 hours
  will be provided (1.5 CEU\, with approval from  the local school system).
  This course was developed in collaboration with the Friday Institute for 
 Educational Innovation. The course runs from October 6th - December 8th an
 d educators can join at any point. $18 Members\, $20 Nonmembers.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:NCMA Online Educator Course: Art and SEL
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ncma-educator-online-course-
 art-and-sel
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Workshops & Trainings
END:VEVENT
