X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Calendar 1 Ics": "https://calendar.unc.edu/event/green-that-pays-founders-turning-passion-into-lasting-impact"}
X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20261031T051649Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54355176805245
DTSTART:20261102T140000Z
DTEND:20261102T153000Z
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Launch Chapel Hill and Innovate Carolina. Panelist
 s include Trashy Founder & CEO Laura Olson\, Blue Nova Group Co-founder Wi
 lliam Vizuete and Inoculai Founder & CEO Rachel Burton. Moderated by UNC I
 nstitute for the Environment Director Mike Piehler.\n\n \n\nKick off Ralei
 gh-Durham Climate Week in Chapel Hill. This is the first event of the week
 . Join founders\, investors\, researchers and community leaders from acros
 s the Triangle to start things off.\n\n \n\nSome founders chase trends. Ot
 hers are in it for the love of the game. They’re driven by a problem the
 y can’t stop thinking about and a belief that the world can be better. B
 ut passion alone doesn’t keep the lights on. How do you stay true to you
 r mission while building a company that can last?\n\n \n\nJoin three clima
 te founders who started with conviction and kept going. They’ll share ho
 nest stories from the journey: testing markets\, finding the people who be
 lieve in their work enough to pay for it\, chasing funding\, and growing w
 ithout losing the spark that got them started.\n\n \n\nWhile you’re here
 \, see UNC’s innovation hub. Innovate Carolina Junction is where UNC res
 earchers\, student founders\, startups and community partners come togethe
 r to turn ideas into impact. Join a free tour to see the space\, meet the 
 team and learn how to plug into Carolina’s innovation community. Also\, 
 be sure to check out other upcoming events!\n\n \n\nYes\, there’s parkin
 g. Forget what you’ve heard about parking in Chapel Hill. A large new pa
 rking deck sits directly across the street from the Junction on East Rosem
 ary Street\, so you can park and walk right in.
GEO:35.914361;-79.054904
LOCATION:Innovate Carolina Junction
SUMMARY:Green That Pays: Founders Turning Passion into Lasting Impact
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/green-that-pays-founders-turni
 ng-passion-into-lasting-impact
CATEGORIES:Lectures
CATEGORIES:Meetings and Conferences
END:VEVENT
