 uirement for Faculty and Staff as well as the <b>714 RCR credit</b> for g
 raduate students\, but participants must attend for 60 minutes and partic
 ipate in breakout room discussion to receive credit. \n\nContact: \nASIST
  \nasist@duke.edu
