DESCRIPTION:What was the Revolutionary War like for the average solider? Se
 arching through a variety of records\, our archivists show what the life o
 f an average soldier was and what came after the war. The life of a solide
 r was not an easy one\, but what came after could be just as difficult. If
  you are in Manteo on November 3\, stop by the Roanoke Island Festival Par
 k to view the One-Day Wonder exhibit\, "North Carolinians’ Fight for Ind
 ependence: The Soldier’s Experience".
GEO:35.910864;-75.665174
LOCATION:Roanoke Island Festival Park
SUMMARY:The Soldiers' Experience Come to Roanoke Island Festival Park
