BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/dqwqbvyjcpbfb/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Trail Tuesday night ride....casual style ... at Williamson Preserv
 e
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T200000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052647Z
UID:event_dqwqbvyjcpbfb@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261103T174500
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261018T130821Z
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Off Road Cyclists (TORC)\n***PLEASE CHECK https://www
 .trianglemtb.com/ FOR TRAIL STATUS.***\\*\n\nIf the trail is closed the ri
 de is canceled.\n\\*\\*\\*\\*BRING LIGHTS!!!!!!!!!!\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n
 \nThis is NOT a true beginner mountain biker friendly ride.\n\nThis is a g
 ood ride for those new to night riding or those who just want to check it 
 out.\n\nThis is a **casual** no drop ride for riders who want to ride and 
 socialize. This is not a race or a Strava KOM fest.\n\nWe normally split i
 nto 2 groups if there are enough riders.... a casual group and a super cas
 ual group.\nBoth groups will be no drop and will stop to regroup often to 
 ensure no one is left behind.\n\nWe will meet between 5:30-5:45pm and hit 
 the trail at 6:00pm.\nWe hang out to chitchat after the ride ... (sometime
 s with hot cocoa and baked goods) so come for the ride\, stay for the laug
 hs (and cocoa).\n\n**Traffic sucks on the way to Williamson so give yourse
 lf more time to get there then you think you will need. Please be ready to
  ride at 6:00pm**\n\nWe will meet at the white barn on the opposite side o
 f the church from the main trail head parking lot. Parking here is by spec
 ial permission for the ride. (Parking here without special permission from
  TLC is not allowed and considered trespassing so please only park here wi
 th TLC's permission.)\n\nPLEASE SEE THE LINK BELOW FOR PARKING. DO NOT PAR
 K AT THE REGULAR PARKING LOT.\n\nhttps://www.google.com/maps/place/35%C2%B
 043'57.9%22N+78%C2%B026'54.0%22W/@35.7327613\,-78.4505187\,17z/data=!3m1!4
 b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x0:0x0!7e2!8m2!3d35.7327571!4d-78.4483296\n\nMountain bike\,
  helmet\, and light are required.\nNO ONE CAN RIDE WITHOUT A HELMET.\nGlov
 es\, water bottle/pack\, mini-tool\, spare tube\, and pump/CO2 highly reco
 mmended.\n\nMessage me with any questions you may have.\n\nPlease fill out
  the 2026 TORC ride waiver. The link is below. It only needs to be filled 
 out 1 time per year.\n\nhttps://www.webscorer.com/register?raceid=415052\n
 \n**HOW TO HELP TORC HELP YOU:**\nIf you aren't a member of TORC please co
 nsider joining. Trails are not cheap to build or easy to maintain. So much
  goes on behind the scenes at all the trails. If you love trails please co
 nsider joining TORC to help support the work TORC does. You may join TORC 
 at https://www.torc-nc.org/join-torc/\n\nAlso please consider donating to 
 Triangle Land Conservancy (TLC). https://www.triangleland.org/give/donate\
 n\nP.S. All the cool kids wear mismatched socks on Trail Tuesday.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T130822Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://www.meetup.com/torc-nc/events/dqwqbvyjcpbfb/
X-SOURCE:Triangle Cycling
END:VEVENT
