LAST-MODIFIED:20260303T163305Z
UID:10227985-1793728800-1793736000@downtowndurham.com
SUMMARY:First Tuesday Social Ride
DESCRIPTION:Pull up and ride with us! \nBlack Spoke Society’s First Tuesday rides are no-drop\, social-paced group rides built for connection\, joy\, and getting outside together. Whether you’re brand new to cycling\, dusting off your bike\, or ride every week\, you belong here. We roll at a conversational pace\, pause when needed\, and make sure no one gets left behind. This is about community over competition. Come as you are. Bring a friend. Bring your whole self. \nExpect:\n– A chill\, steady pace\n– Good music and even better vibes\n– Route support and ride leaders\n– Water + snack stops when needed\n– Post-ride hangs when the mood is right \nHelmet required. Lights encouraged. Good energy mandatory. Let’s ride. 🖤🚴🏾‍♀️
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/first-tuesday-social-ride/2026-11-03/
LOCATION:CCB Plaza\, 201 Corcoran St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:African-American,Bicycling,Fitness,Free,LGBTQ,Outdoors
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/3-1.png-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Black Spoke Society":MAILTO:blackspokesociety@gmail.com
GEO:35.996654;-78.901784
