DESCRIPTION:A free guided tour of Fort Macon is available daily at 1:00 p.m
 . during the non-summer season from mid Oct. to mid April.\n\nTours last a
 bout 45 minutes.\n\nMeet at the fort entrance. Pets are not allowed inside
  the fort.\n\n \n\nPhoto by C. Peek: The fort at Fort Macon State Park
