BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Freedom Fridays:  Durham
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T090000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052534Z
UID:5drhdmrgv5f9bqmm9e1kadr8kc@google.com__20261106
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260713T172355Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy. In the summer mon
 ths\, we will meet from on Fridays 8-9am at MLK and Hope Valley Road. Star
 ting in September\, we will shift back to the afternoons from 4-5:00pm at 
 South Roxboro St. &amp\; Martin Luther King Jr. Parkway\, Durham\, NC 2771
 3.\n\nFor the summer months (am time)\, parking is best at St Andrew&#39\;
 s Court or Reynolds Avenue N.\n\nThis will be a POSITIVE and nonviolent de
 monstration. We are here to protect our democracy. We are standing up for 
 what we believe in. We want to inspire people to join us and grow our move
 ment!\n\nPlease bring positive signs only. Some examples: Instead of &quot
 \;Stop defunding science&quot\; Say &quot\;Protect Research&quot\; &quot\;
 Immigrants make us stronger&quot\; &quot\;Housing for all&quot\; &quot\;He
 althcare for all&quot\; &quot\;Save the planet&quot\;\n\nMake signs about 
 what you&#39\;re standing up for -- whether that is the libraries\, DEI\, 
 healthcare\, women’s rights\n\nPlease no mocking signs\, no swastikas\n\
 nWe are excited to see you there and stand together for our country!\n\nSe
 e you every Friday engaging drivers in Durham.\n\nPlease join our Substack
 : <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://substack.com/profile/11548
