DESCRIPTION:Join us for this free event based on the true story of the Gour
 d Patch Conspiracy\, this immersive experience brings to life the tension\
 , intrigue\, and divided loyalties of 1777. The two-day event includes spe
 cial guided tours\, self-guided building tours\, AND a special program cen
 tered around the Trial of John Lewelling\, founder of the Gourd Patch Cons
 piracy.\n\nDue to limited seating for the trial portion of our event\, tic
 kets are required and may be purchased in advance  (Tuesday-Saturday\, 9am
 -5pm)  at the Historic Edenton Visitor Center\, 108 N Broad St. You may al
 so call to reserve tickets: (252) 632-5020 or to request more information.
