END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_enoriver_org_9u7o786v1jlk6heq5cp3k1gr1k
SUMMARY:ERA - Fall Nature Fun Day!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T160000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052537Z
UID:70s31ubt8h6o9apcnsheujmsko@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T120000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261016T150327Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>NOTE: This event has been rescheduled from Saturday\, Oc
 tober 17th due to inclement weather. We will hold the event on Saturday\, 
 November 7th. Same time\, same place!</b></p><p>Help the Eno River Associa
 tion celebrate the sights\, smells\, and sounds of fall on the Eno River! 
 Join us for a <b>FREE</b>\, family-friendly day of hands-on fun at the Con
 fluence Natural Area.</p><p>Get your hands and feet wet while searching th
 e creek for aquatic macroinvertebrates\, make a festive fall-inspired craf
 t\, and learn about some of the Eno’s most fascinating “spooky” spec
 ies. </p><p><b>This event is FREE and registration is NOT required.</b>
  Drop by anytime between noon and 4pm. <b>Geared toward families with kid
 s\, but nature lovers of all ages are welcome. </b><br></p><p><em>Restroo
 ms are available on-site. Two accessible parking spaces connect the paved 
 sidewalk to the pavilion. At least one activity will take place in the pav
 ed pavilion. </em></p><p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:educatio@enori
 ver.org" target="_blank"><u>education@enoriver.org</u></a> <u></u>for mor
 e information about this event.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20261016T150327Z
LOCATION:Confluence Natural Area\, 4214 Highland Farm Rd\, Hillsborough\, 
 NC 27278\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Eno River Association
END:VEVENT
