 earn food preservation methods used on the Vance plantation\, and take hom
 e 19th-century recipes to try for yourself!\n\nAppalachian Foodways Tours 
 are offered at 10am and 1pm and will last approximately 90 minutes. Ticket
 s are $10.70 per person via Zeffy. Spots are limited\, so we encourage you
  to reserve your tickets in advance! If you have any questions\, please fe
 el free to reach out to vance@dncr.nc.gov or give us a call at (828) 645-6
 706.
