DTSTAMP:20261031T052605Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54363568797235
DTSTART:20261107T230000Z
DTEND:20261108T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Veterans Day with a US Navy Band concert!  On Saturda
 y\, November 7th\, the Battleship will host the U.S. Fleet Forces Band for
  a special and free concert!  The 1-hour concert will begin at 6:00 pm on 
 the Battleship's fantail. \n\nThe U.S. Fleet Forces Band (USFF) known as t
 he "Finest in the Fleet" serves as the musical ambassador for Commander\, 
 U.S. Fleet Forces Command in Norfolk\, VA.  One of their primary missions 
 is to provide musical support for military ceremonies and events\, foreign
  dignitaries and Navy community outreach engagements throughout the Mid-At
 lantic and Ohio River Valley areas of the U.S.  Performing will be the "Fo
 ur Star Edition" popular music group of the USFF.\n\nThis event is free bu
 t tickets are required. Space is limited! For info and tickets: https://bi
 t.ly/usffb-battleship\nPlease bring your own chairs\, refreshments\, and b
 lankets.
GEO:34.236158;-77.953643
LOCATION: Battleship North Carolina\, Fantail
SUMMARY:Veterans Day Navy Band Concert
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/veterans-day-navy-band-conce
 rt
