DESCRIPTION:Join us for a moving tribute at the Veterans Celebration\, a da
 y dedicated to honoring the brave men and women who have served our countr
 y.\n\nGuests can experience military displays\, veteran-focused vendors\, 
 and live music from the Gaston Symphonic Band in Stowe Park and the Upper 
 Field.\n\nThis event invites the whole community to come together to recog
 nize and thank those who have served\, creating meaningful moments of refl
 ection\, appreciation\, and pride.
