DESCRIPTION:A Gathering of Voices is a cultural experience blending live mu
 sic and oral history honoring 250 years of North Carolina Music. The event
  will include a video screening produced by Aniya Bourne for the MIC (the 
 Music Industry Center) and spirit FREEDOM as well as a mini-concert by The
  Al Strong Trio.\n\nThe event will be held at the Eno Arts Mill (437 Dimmo
 cks Mill Rd. Suite #17) 3PM – 5PM on November 8. \n\nFunded by an Americ
 a 250 NC grant.
