DESCRIPTION:America 250\n\nNovember 8th at 3pm\nMeymandi Concert Hall\n\nPr
 ogram (approx. 82 minutes)\n\nCome celebrate America’s 250th Birthday wi
 th us as we present patriotic works by American composers\, featuring “T
 he Song of Democracy” by Howard Hanson (on a poem of Walt Whitman)\, “
 The Promise of Living” by Aaron Copland\, and the final movement of Mich
 ael Daugherty’s “Mount Rushmore” (dedicated to Abraham Lincoln).
GEO:35.77126;-78.639608
LOCATION:Martin Marietta Center for the Performing Arts\, Raleigh\, NC
SUMMARY:America 250 Concert
