 at wants to use your phone and see wildlife from a different perspective\,
  this is for you.\n\n \n\nMeeting Location: Lake James Park Paddy's Creek 
 Access - East Shelter\n\nDuration: Approximately 2 hours 9:00am - 11am\n\n
 Please Bring: Water\, personal floatation device (provided if you do not h
 ave) sunglasses.\n\nEverybody must register prior to the event to have a s
 pot on the boat. Registration is only for the name listed\; children or sp
 ouses must register separately. Space is limited to 6 people. If you canno
 t make it\, please call us so we can open the spot for another person
