DESCRIPTION:Unmaking Eden: Rethinking Domestication\n\n \n\nDavid Carr\, Pr
 ofessor of Old Testament at Union Theological Seminary\, offers a new read
 ing of Genesis through the lens of human-animal studies. Drawing on his ne
 w book\, Unmaking Eden\, Carr asks how these ancient stories have shaped i
 deas about humans\, animals\, and our relationship to the natural world.
