 oks\, a live concert with Luke Vuncannon and The Axe Handlers\, and a spec
 tacular 150-drone patriotic aerial show lighting up the night sky!\n\n📅
  Tuesday\, November 10\, 2026\n📍 Cole Auditorium\, 1042 W. Hamlet Avenu
 e\, Hamlet\, NC\n🕕 Doors open at 6:00 PM | Concert at 7:00 PM | Drone s
 how at 8:15 PM\n\n🎟️ FREE admission! Family-friendly!\n\n✨ Come for
