DESCRIPTION:For questions\, contact Vern Bothwell at vernb2017@gmail.com. 
 The location will be Eno River State Park – Few’s Ford Access. 6101 Co
 le Mill Road\, Durham\, NC 27705.\n\nDrive straight into the park and go t
 o the parking loop/area at the end of the entry road. \n\nThis outing is 
