DESCRIPTION:Join Friends of Lower Haw and State Parks educator Sean Higgins
  to build your own toy boat out of recycled materials. We will consider sc
 ience and engineering\, including balance and buoyancy. Then we will test 
 your creation by floating it down a section of the Haw River. Our program 
 captain\, Sean\, will wade out into the river so nobody needs to get their
  feet wet unless they want to. All ages are welcome\, no registration requ
 ired for this free event. This America 250 event on Veteran’s Day is in 
 honor of George Washington’s historic crossing of the Delaware River in 
 winter of 1776 that saved the American Revolution
