SUMMARY:Triangle Tech Net
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Tech Net\n**Triangle Tech Net: Your Next Big Move Sta
 rts Here.**\nThe Triangle’s fastest-growing tech networking event is bac
 k — and we’re turning up the energy.\n\nWhether you're eyeing your nex
 t career move or searching for top-tier talent\, *this* is where the Trian
 gle's tech ecosystem comes to connect\, collaborate\, and create real oppo
 rtunities.\n\nNovember 13th\, 2026\n7:30–9:30 AM\n**No entry will be per
 mitted after 8:15 AM**\n6501 Weston Parkway\, Suite #300\, Cary\, NC 27513
 \nBusiness Casual\n\n**What's In It For You:**\n**Direct Access to Decisio
 n Makers** — Meet hiring managers\, recruiters\, tech leaders\, and peer
 s face-to-face.\n**Actionable Insights** — Learn what’s working *right
  now* in hiring\, career moves\, and talent acquisition.\n**Off-Market Opp
 ortunities** — Discover jobs\, partnerships\, and connections you won’
 t find posted online.\n**Real Community** — Build a network that actuall
 y works for you.\n**This isn’t a coffee-and-business-card swap. It’s y
 our chance to move the needle.**\n\nAdmission is free — but space fills 
 fast. Reserve your spot today.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ttn-rtp/events/317048628/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
