X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_f511c08827b961733168ea93761e472cd12de35e813c3a73af3e44c56b7fe53d
SUMMARY:UU Justice NC’s Friday Action Hour
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T120000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052534Z
UID:1tvd180uho6fnokuhaj2c5h1k8_R20251107T160000@google.com__20261113
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250729T151905Z
DESCRIPTION:11:00am-12:00pm: Unitarian Universalist Justice NC’s Friday 
 Action Hour. <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/w/87452791684?_x_zm_rtaid=7M
 gmJB_hSsCKh3xUYHZrBA.1750590489156.1865f9b53934845e34cb2d06c2d1adc5&_x_zm_
 rhtaid=5#success" target="_blank"><u>Zoom here </u></a><br><u> </u><br><
 p>Since May of 2020\, North Carolina UUs and friends have gathered on Frid
 ays to take action and experience the joy and power of community. Every Fr
 iday at 11:00am we recap the past week and take action on the issues impac
 ting our state and country. And there is always great music to help us fee
 l the justice movement in our bones! ALL are welcome! We are also blessed 
 to be joined by Unitarian Universalists\, our beloved North Carolina justi
 ce partners\, and dear friends from outside our state (shout out to our We
 st Virginia fam!).</p><p>You can join us <strong>every Friday </strong>at 
 11:00 am via this <a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZMpcu
 uvpzosEtAhdqFHrSySSb6REM8wkPru">Zoom link</a>. And if you can't make it on
  Fridays\, you can still take action at any time - just check out our <a h
 ref="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Fwj6m0Qw4fAH_keuIoUNgdSWslBZzVgQ5
 NCgVPm_L-U/edit?tab=t.0" class="pastedDriveLink-0">Weekly action list</a>.
  And sign up for our <a href="https://secure.everyaction.com/QSBiJQ1YQEGwP
 O2KMIRIkQ2" target="_blank">Weekly Friday Action Hour Email</a> that inclu
 des a promo of the week's actions\, Zoom link\, and link to our Actions Go
 ogle Doc.</p><p><a href="https://www.uujusticenc.org/get-involved/friday-a
 ction-hour/">https://www.uujusticenc.org/get-involved/friday-action-hour/<
 /a> </p><u> </u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251031T142802Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (Virtual NC)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Nchumanities": "https://nchumanities.org/event/griot-and-grey-owl-blk-southern-writers-conference-book-fest/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:nchumanities
X-SOURCE:NC Humanities Council
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T153000
DTSTAMP:20261014T181918Z
CREATED:20261014T181918Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T181918Z
UID:10001457-1794567600-1794756600@nchumanities.org
SUMMARY:Griot and Grey Owl Blk Southern Writers Conference & Book Fest
DESCRIPTION:Griot & Grey Owl Black Southern Writers Conference 2026 \nJoin us November 13–15\, 2026\, in Durham\, NC for the Griot & Grey Owl Black Southern Writers Conference\, a three-day celebration of Black Southern literature\, storytelling\, culture\, and community. \nThis year’s theme\, “We Were Never Meant to Survive: Rest\, Resilience and Radical Joy\,” explores how Black writers and communities use storytelling to preserve memory\, imagine possibility\, reclaim rest\, and create joy. Featuring Danez Smith as Keynote Speaker\, the weekend brings together writers\, readers\, educators\, artists\, editors\, and literary professionals for readings\, workshops\, conversations\, panels\, a literary arts fair\, and community-centered programming. \nCome gather with us as we honor the stories that have carried us\, the voices shaping our present\, and the possibilities we are writing toward. \nNovember 13–15\, 2026 | Durham\, NC\nTickets & Information: griotandgreyowl.org/tickets-2026
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/griot-and-grey-owl-blk-southern-writers-conference-book-fest/
LOCATION:HUB RTP\, 500 Park Offices Dr\,\, Durham\, NC\, 27713\, United States
CATEGORIES:Humanities Sector Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/105125-scaled.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Griot and Grey Owl Blk Southern Writers Conference":MAILTO:griotandgreyowl@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
