BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_newhopeaudubon
SUMMARY:NHBA Bird Outing
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T110000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052643Z
UID:49r0ci82flrc8drkcriamccqdk@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T080000
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20261027T173644Z
DESCRIPTION:Contact Marshall Michener at <a href="mailto:marshallmichener
 @ymail.com" target="_blank"><u>marshallmichener@ymail.com</u></a>  with 
 questions. The location will be Mason Farm Biological Preserve in Chapel H
 ill\, located behind the Finley Golf Course at 500 Finley Golf Course Rd.\
 , Chapel Hill. <br><br>Going south on US 15-501\, turn left onto Old Maso
 n Farm Rd. at the stop light. After about a mile\, turn right at the entra
 nce to Finley and drive around the back of the clubhouse to the parking lo
 t. Drive through the parking lot and continue onto a paved road at the bac
 k\, right-hand corner of the lot. Follow this road about 100 feet (just pa
 st the practice putting green) until you come to a fork in the road and ta
 ke the right-hand fork onto a gravel road. Go about 0.5 miles until you co
 me to a junction. Turn right to cross a concrete low water crossing across
  Morgan Creek. Go over the low water crossing and up the embankment to mee
 t in the parking lot. <br><br>Heavy rains prior to the event may make the
  low water crossing impassible and result in a location change.<br><br>Thi
 s outing is sponsored by the New Hope Bird Alliance (formerly New Hope Aud
 ubon).<br><br>Outings usually last 2-3 hours. No reservations or sign-up n
 eeded. If there is a large turnout for any particular outing\, we may spli
 t into two groups. We do recommend carpooling for families or friend pods\
 ; while we love pets\, there is a ‘no-pet’ policy for bird outings. Ne
 w birders and birders of all skill levels are welcome. <br><br>Please wea
 r long pants\, socks\, and sturdy shoes (ticks and chiggers may be present
 ). Sun and bug protection are also recommended. Bring snacks and water if 
 you like. Heavy rain will result in cancellation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T173644Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:New Hope Bird Alliance
END:VEVENT
