 show how you can learn from books and archival materials.\n\n \n\nYou can 
 also enjoy current special collections exhibitions:\n\nWitnesses to the Re
 volution: North Carolina and the War for IndependenceThe Touch of Art: Ame
 rican Book Design 1880-1930Campaigns\, Causes and Collectibles: Political 
 Memorabilia in the North Carolina Collection.Special Display: The Odyssey
