X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/quiet-book-club"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20261031T052606Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54356834094827
DTSTART:20261114T160000Z
DTEND:20261114T173000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come and read at your own pace\, comfortably relaxing in the wo
 ods. We will meet at the park office and walk to our spot. We will have a 
 few blankets to lay on\, and a few chairs to relax in\, but you are welcom
 e to bring your own. We will read for about an hour and then chat for abou
 t thirty. You could bring a book you've been reading for three months\, or
  a book you started this morning - the only requirement is that you show u
 p with your book and read it in the company of other people doing the same
  thing. \n\nThis event is being put on by Friends of Carvers Creek State P
 ark. \n\nWe will meet in picnic area across from the parking lot.
