 iew at the vast beauty of the sky above us? Would you like to learn about 
 the wild parts of our universe while sipping some hot chocolate? If so\, j
 oin us for our Stargazing Night! This event is after hours\, from 5:30pm t
 o 7:00pm. You'll get a bonus sticker for bringing your own reusable mug!  
 \n\nThis event is being hosted by the Friends of Carvers Creek State Park.
