DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T160000
SUMMARY:Sunday Community Game Day at The Can Opener
DESCRIPTION:Durham Geeks\nWhat is up\, my fellow humans?! Need somewhere t
 o go or something to do this Sunday afternoon? How do some good games\, go
 od people\, and good food sound??? I thought so. You want to be here!\n\nC
 ome join us at our new (hopefully permanent) spot\, The Can Opener\, for s
 ome Sunday afternoon board gaming shenanigans! As always\, we always bring
  an egregious number of games\, so feel free to come in and let us teach y
 ou something new! Even if you’re new to board games or just want to try 
 something new\, we will get you a seat and make sure you don’t have to s
 tumble through a rulebook. Of course\, you are more than welcome to bring 
 a game of your own to play if you’re a seasoned gamer (or just really lo
 ve that ONE game!) we will get it to the table!\n\nThe Can Opener has a to
 n of great food options from one of their food trucks. There is also a gre
 at selection of snacks inside along with great coffee and whatever beverag
 e(s) you may want! The spot is cozy\, well lit\, dog friendly\, and super 
 inclusive\, not to mention that we have a great group of friends that will
  make you feel right at home! Can't ask for much more than that.\n\nSo com
 e on out and let's show The Can Opener some of that good Durham Game Commu
 nity LOVE!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/durham-geeks/events/317147196/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261026T161453Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261026T161453Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
