SUMMARY:BEAT | Featuring the Music of King Crimson
DESCRIPTION:Following more than 100 acclaimed performances across North and
  South America\, Europe\, and Japan\, BEAT returns this fall for the last 
 North American tour. Former King Crimson members Adrian Belew and Tony Lev
 in are joined by guitar virtuoso Steve Vai and legendary drummer Terry Boz
 zio to perform the music of the three landmark 1980s King Crimson albums
 —Discipline\, Beat\, and Three of a Perfect Pair.\n\nRather than attempt
 ing to recreate the original recordings\, BEAT brings this extraordinary m
 usic to life with the spirit\, precision\, and adventurousness that made i
 t so enduring. Whether you've lived with these albums for decades or are d
 iscovering them for the first time\, this is the final opportunity to expe
 rience one of progressive music's most celebrated catalogs performed by fo
 ur of the best musicians on the planet.\n\nClick here to purchase tickets.
