SUMMARY:CSA Triangle November Meet-Up | Surviving 2027: Live and Unscripte
 d
DESCRIPTION:Cloud Security Alliance Triangle Chapter\nPanel Discussion Top
 ic:\n"Surviving 2027: Live and Unscripted – A Candid\, No-Pitch Look at 
 Cloud Data and Privacy Risk"\n\nHighlights of Panel discussion:\nVendors a
 nd their customers\, one stage\, no pitches: a candid look at cloud data a
 nd privacy risk heading into 2027.\nWe expect this to be high energy panel
