DTEND:20261121T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the Richard Caswell Memorial Site (2612 W Verno
 n Ave\, Kinston) for a day of mustering the militia\, celebrating our own 
 250th birthday. The Dobbs County militia will conduct musket demonstration
 s\, cannon demonstrations\, a period ration distribution. Other activities
  include what the civilians would do while following the militia. Textile 
 displays to include weaving\, knitting\, and sewing as well as children's 
 activities and a period apothecary. \n\nThe event is free to the public\, 
 but donations are excepted.\n\nInquiries please call: 252-526-9600 or cont
 act us by email dave.stone@dncr.nc.gov or randi.shaw@dncr.nc.gov\n\nWe loo
 k forward to seeing you there!
GEO:35.260403;-77.581573
LOCATION:CSS Neuse Civil War Museum\, Governor Caswell Memorial
SUMMARY:Mustering the Militia
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/mustering-the-militia-1369
