 der half a mile that is better to get your blood pumping rather than wear 
 you out\, so it's a perfect opportunity to recover from the previous day a
 nd get outside with the family. \n\nPlease wear atheltic running shoes\nBr
 ing water\nLeashed pets are welcome\n\nEvent is subject to cancel due to p
 oor weather. Please click the "I'm Interested" button as event will cancel
