 vember 28th from 4 – 7 PM for a light display like no other. Kites with 
 Lights\, at Jockey’s Ridge State Park\, features large 19-to-30-foot kit
 es decked out in the spirit of the holiday season! At 5 PM\, enjoy the lig
 hting of the Jockey’s Ridge State Park Solar Christmas tree out on the d
 unes directly across from Jockey’s Ridge Crossing.  Warm beverages are a
 vailable across the street at Jockey’s Ridge Crossing. All donations ben
