UID:event_317097643@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261031T052547Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261201T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261201T213000
SUMMARY:*IN-PERSON* SF/F Group
DESCRIPTION:Durham Writers Group\nWe will be at the People's Solidarity Hu
 b at 1805 Chapel Hill Rd\, Durham (the teal building). This venue does not
  serve food or drink\, but feel free to bring your own. There is a kitchen
 ette for our use\, but be sure to clean up afterwards. The space might be 
 a little cozy\; please consider masking or staying home if you have a resp
 iratory ailment.\n\nThis sub-group focuses on Speculative Fiction\, includ
 ing Science Fiction\, Fantasy and Horror. If you have anything that falls 
 under that category — be it short story\, poem\, novel-in-progress or sc
 reenplay — then come! We'd love to hear from you.\n\nOur format allows e
 ach reader 15 minutes to present their work aloud\, followed by approximat
 ely 20 minutes of feedback from the other attendees. To ensure fairness\, 
 each attendee is limited to 1 minute of Initial Feedback time. During that
  period\, the author remains silent. Next\, we have a 5 minute Free-For-Al
 l discussion about the work -- then the author may speak. (We usually get 
 through three readers.)\n\nThough not required\, in order to receive more 
 in-depth feed-back\, readers may post their work in advance on our Google 
 Group:\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/forum/durham-sff-writers-group\n\nWe a
 sk that participants keep their comments constructive and respectful\, foc
 using on what works or doesn't work in the piece.\n\nWe also ask that read
 ers provide a warning\, both on the Google Group and during the meeting\, 
 if their story features content that some readers might find upsetting. Th
 is includes descriptions of violence or sexual content.\n\nReaders are:\n
 •\n•\n•\n\nBackup Readers are:\n•\n•\n•\n\nDeep Backup:\n•\n
 \n***\n\n***We meet every Tuesday at the same time\, but alternate between
  In-Person*** ***and on Zoom. Members may attend both formats\, if desired
 \, but readers will be listed separately under the In-Person or Zoom weeks
 .***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/dwg-writers/events/317097643/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261022T233640Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T233640Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
