X-SOURCE-ID:calendar_1_ics
X-SOURCE:UNC Chapel Hill
DTSTAMP:20261031T051651Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54364118795627
DTSTART:20261202T170000Z
DTEND:20261202T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Most of us reach a point in life when parents or elderly relati
 ves begin to require more attention and time\, and sometimes\, our financi
 al support as well. Caring for an older person can be complicated and few 
 of us are trained for the many aspects of that care. Providing care for an
  elder is a very personal matter. No two situations are the same and there
  are no simple solutions. You can\, though\, benefit from following some p
 ractical suggestions.\n\n \n\n\nBalancing work\, family and care-giving re
 sponsibilities can present some challenges. This workshop provides an over
 view of information to help the participant cope with their personal life 
 while dealing with their elder’s needs.\n\n \n\nClick on Carolina Talent
  registration link and select the “Request” button to automatically en
 roll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:The Sandwich Generation: Balancing Your Personal Life with the Need
 s of Your Older Parents or Loved Ones
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/the-sandwich-generation-balanc
 ing-your-personal-life-with-the-needs-of-your-older-parents-or-loved-ones
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
