DESCRIPTION:Temple Theatre is one of North Carolina's premier regional thea
 tres\, offering Broadway-quality productions in the heart of downtown Sanf
 ord. Based on the beloved film\, this holiday classic features an iconic s
 core with 17 legendary Irving Berlin standards\, including “Sisters\,”
  “Blue Skies\,” “I Love a Piano\,” and the timeless title song. Ce
 lebrate the season with high-energy tap numbers\, vibrant 1950s period cos
 tumes\, and a “million-dollar production feel.” Temple invites you to 
 a Happy Holiday\, feel-good experience for all ages culminating in a snowy
 \, heartwarming finale.\n\nTickets range from $25 to $40 with discounts av
 ailable for active military\, Lee County educators and students\, and grou
 ps of 10 or more. Visit templeshows.org or call 919-774-4512 for more info
 rmation.
GEO:35.48114;-79.178793
LOCATION:Temple Theatre
SUMMARY:Temple Theatre Presents: "White Christmas"
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/temple-theatre-presents-whit
 e-christmas
