 are River in 1776 and view a special holiday tree decorated with victory-t
 hemed ornaments. Hosted by the Dare A250 Committee and the Daughters of th
 e American Revolution (DAR) Virginia Dare Chapter\, this free event will a
 lso feature: Liberty & Light: A Washington’s Victory Tree Celebration Mo
 nday\, December 7\, 2026 10 a.m. to 3 p.m. Dare County Administration Lobb
 y (954 Marshall Collins Dr. Manteo\, NC) light refreshments festive music 
 display of virginia dare a250 quilt burying of dare a250 time capsule\n\nT
 his special event will mark the conclusion of Dare County’s yearlong Dar
 e A250 celebrations.
