 <br>Sprint up the final hill<br>Not a sanctioned ride\, ride at your own r
 isk</p><p>Route:<br><a target="_blank" href="https://www.strava.com/routes
 /3093210775188587926">https://www.strava.com/routes/3093210775188587926</a
 ></p>
