SUMMARY:Transforming Families Support Group
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261220T180000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052543Z
UID:0t0qogsjr15cealr0j0p01dt1d_R20260920T203000@google.com__20261220
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20240610T220903Z
DESCRIPTION:Transforming Families NC: In-person in Durham<br><p>Meet fello
 w parents and caregivers raising transgender\, non-binary and gender diver
 se youth in a safe\, affirming space. We'll share knowledge\, experienc
 es &amp\; concerns. Confidentiality is very important\, as we are all at d
 ifferent stages of our journey.</p><p>Join us on the 1st and 3rd Sunday o
 f the month from 4:30pm to 6pm for an open and honest discussion group for
  parents of gender creative children (child’s age does not matter). </p
 ><p>Contact Alix or Nan for more information at: <a href="mailto:transfor
 mingfamiliesnc@lgbtqcenterofdurham.org" target="_blank">transformingfamili
 esnc@<u></u>lgbtqcenterofdurham.org</a></p><p>Childcare not provided at th
 is time. Self-minding children may be present in our small library space.<
 /p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260920T210244Z
LOCATION:114 Hunt St\, Durham\, NC 27701\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
