LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T165556Z
UID:10000129-1798275600-1798282800@triangleland.org
SUMMARY:Speed Hike at Johnston Mill
DESCRIPTION:Come join TLC for an invigorating speed hike to wake up your Saturday morning!\nThis hike is led by one of our wonderful Trail Guides\, Jon.W\, and will have a goal pace of 20 minutes per mile for about 3 miles. Explore Johnston Mill and see what all you can find while keeping your heart healthy and socializing on trail.  Remember to bring a full bottle of water and wear comfortable walking shoes that will help you navigate rocks and roots along the trail. This is a free event\, but preregistration is required.\n\n 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/speed-hike-at-johnston-mill-8
LOCATION:Johnston Mill Main Entrance\, 2713 Mt. Sinai Rd\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
CATEGORIES:Excercise,Health,Hike,Social
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Defend Democracy Saturdays: Downtown Durham
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261226T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261226T113000
DTSTAMP:20261031T052534Z
UID:7vihpmeg1k6esqp5s5vsvq9hfe_R20260110T150000@google.com__20261226
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20251010T141601Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy every Saturday 
 from 10am-11:30am with signs to protect our democracy and protest the viol
 ations to our Constitution. We will meet at the YMCA at 218 West Morgan St
 .</p><p>We need to fight for our democracy and stop and prevent future cut
 s that are hurting many. Bring friends! Bring signs that show your concern
  or are a call to action. Please avoid triggering images like swastikas.</
 p><p>See you every Saturday morning engaging drivers &amp\; pedestrians in
  Downtown Durham!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </span><a href="h
 ttps://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy">https
 ://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy</a></p><p>
 For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://www.mobilize
 .us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersf
 ordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfor
 democracy/event/842514/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocra
 cy/event/842514/</a> </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260108T021307Z
LOCATION:218 W Morgan St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
