DESCRIPTION:Join us every Sunday as we discuss how we combat authoritarian
 ism and make the world a safer and more caring place with progressive cand
 idates\, policies\, and solidarity. You'll leave energized\, organized\, a
 nd definitely more hopeful.<br><br>ZOOM LINK: <a href="https://us06web.zo
